sec.p:
The active acupuncture group had a higher cessation rate of sleeping medication during 18–20 weeks than the sham control (56.5% vs. 14.3%, P = 0.011). Dosage of sleeping medications and weekly frequency of use were not significantly different between groups (Fig. 2, Additional file 1: eTable S2A). Characteristics of participants use sedatives, hypnotics, anxiolytics in two groups were similar (Fig. 2, Additional file 1: eTable S2B).Fig. 2
